            <en-US
                content="When ON, audio is adjusted so the volume stays as close as possible to 0 dB or below." />
            <zh-CN content="开启后，会调整音频，使音量尽量不超过 0dB。" />
            <zh-TW content="開啟後，會調整音訊，使音量盡量不超過 0dB。" />
